#: mapbox_help.py:57
msgid "The keys stay on this device. Search and routes work as soon as they're saved."
msgstr "As chaves ficam neste aparelho. A busca e as rotas funcionam assim que forem salvas."

#: mapbox_help.py:23
msgid "Make a Mapbox account"
msgstr "Criar uma conta Mapbox"

